  {
   "id": 632965,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"3\">\n  <li>Enter the given data into Desmos, then calculate the regression approximation to determine the curve of best fit.     <table class=\"unnumbered\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"x_1\">x_1</span></th>\n          <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"y_1\">y_1</span></th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td>0.2</td>\n          <td>6.5</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>0.35</td>\n          <td>6.74</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>0.66</td>\n          <td>6.31</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>1</td>\n          <td>4.95</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>1.5</td>\n          <td>1.2</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </li>\n</ol>\n<p>What is the equation for the curve of best fit that models the data?</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1225883,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"y = -5.1x^2 + 9.2x + 7.14\">y = -5.1x^2 + 9.2x + 7.14</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1225886,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"y = -4.31x^2+ 3.2x + 6.08\">y = -4.31x^2+ 3.2x + 6.08</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1225884,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"y = -3.1x^2+ 2.6x + 7.93\">y = -3.1x^2+ 2.6x + 7.93</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1225885,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"y = -6.3x^2+ 8x + 10.6\">y = -6.3x^2+ 8x + 10.6</span>"
    }
   ],
